  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Telekinesis; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> hands; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe wearer of these gloves improves the strength and grip of their telekinesis. Add a +2 bonus on their CMB and CMD checks when they use the Telekinetic Maneuver or Steal talents.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Telekinesis sphere (Forceful Telekinesis, Telekinetic Maneuver); <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 8000 gp, complete pair.</p><p>One complete one-pound glove pair improves only the specified Telekinesis talent CMB/CMD procedures. The actual talents use their own CL/casting-ability calculations; do not add +2 to ordinary combat maneuvers, all CMD, lifting size, Strength, or Swim/Climb. No talent is automatically granted.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
